# The calibration controls are generated, not measured. `control-noisy` is every mapped rule id
# on every non-empty line of both variants of every case: 81,928 findings on corpus 1 and 2,629,968
# on corpus 2, which is 311 MB. It regenerates byte-identically from what IS committed - the rule
# set in mappings/ and, for the teaching corpus, raw/c1-control-inventory.json - with one command:
#     python tools/control_c1.py     python tools/control_c2.py
# Committing it once made this repository 49 MB, 45 of which was one generated file (audit row 47).
raw/c1-control-noisy.json
raw/c1-control-null.json
raw/c2-control-noisy.json
raw/c2-control-null.json
